; A ledger with every reason to doubt it: a commodity priced over a
; year ago, one priced this month, one never priced at all, spend filed
; under a catch-all, and transactions the ledger itself won't vouch
; for — one of them older than the trailing year.
option "title" "Trust"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2025-01-01 open Assets:Checking        USD
2025-01-01 open Assets:Broker          VTI
2025-01-01 open Assets:Vault           GOLD
2025-01-01 open Assets:Crypto          ADA
2025-01-01 open Income:Salary          USD
2025-01-01 open Income:Grant           ADA
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Rent          USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Food          USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Uncategorized USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Misc          USD
2025-01-01 open Equity:Opening         USD

; VTI keeps getting priced; GOLD stopped over a year ago; nothing ever
; priced ADA.
2025-04-01 price VTI  100.00 USD
2026-04-01 price VTI  110.00 USD
2025-01-15 price GOLD 2000.00 USD

2025-01-02 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:Checking  60000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening

; Older than the trailing year, so it counts against the ledger but
; not against the figures on the page.
2025-02-10 ! "Nobody" "Left over from the old importer"
  Expenses:Food  250.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-04-05 * "Buy VTI"
  Assets:Broker  20 VTI {100.00 USD}
  Assets:Checking

2025-04-06 * "Buy gold"
  Assets:Vault   10 GOLD {2000.00 USD}
  Assets:Checking

; Arrives in a commodity nothing prices, so it is missing from every
; total on the page rather than merely out of date.
2025-04-07 * "Grant"
  Income:Grant  -60000 ADA
  Assets:Crypto

2025-05-10 * "Salary"
  Income:Salary  -40000.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-05-15 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  1600.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-06-15 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  1600.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-07-15 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  1600.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-08-15 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  1600.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-09-15 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  1600.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

; Miscellaneous is a decision, so this one is not a gap.
2025-11-15 * "Odds and ends"
  Expenses:Misc  500.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

; The importer gave up on this one twice over: no category, no flag.
2025-12-05 ! "Someone" "Card charge, unidentified"
  Expenses:Uncategorized  500.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-01-15 ! "Diner" "Is this the same place?"
  Expenses:Food  1000.00 USD
  Assets:Checking
